rif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #176b4b; letter-spacing: 0.08em; line-height: 1.3;\">\n                {{company}}\n              </h3>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 0; text-align: left;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a241e; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.3;\">\n                Hi {{name}}, thanks for reaching out!\n              </h1>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 8px 0;\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #46564c; text-align: left;\">Thank you for getting in touch with our team. We received your details and are preparing the information you requested.</p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #46564c; text-align: left;\">Our team will review your inquiry and follow up shortly with next steps.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 14px 0;\">\n              <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f3f8f5; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #e1ece5;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 20px 22px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #176b4b; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px;\">NEXT STEPS</div>\n                    <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1b2820; margin-bottom: 6px;\">What happens next?</div>\n                    <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #48584e;\">1. Our team reviews your inquiry.\n2. We reach out to understand your requirements.\n3. We share relevant information and answer your questions.</div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 16px 0; text-align: center;\">\n              <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0 auto;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; background-color: #176b4b;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://example.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #176b4b;\">\n                      Visit Our Website →\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 20px 0;\">\n              <hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e5eae6; margin: 0;\" />\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 24px 0 10px 0; text-align: center;\">\n              <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #536459; margin-bottom: 4px;\">{{company}}</div>\n              <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #87958b; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Sent to {{email}} because you requested information from us.</div>\n              <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -ap